	- - join the gold standard, all the advanced countries have done
	it. Floating exchange rates and fiat money are only for profligate
	countries. At the beginning of the twenty-first century, the choice
	is also becoming more obvious - - go to floating exchange rates,
	all the advanced countries have done it. Moreover in both eras, the
