	populated areas as well as population changes leading to space shortage
	in larger cities, or even abandonment in small cities. The concept
	of measuring funding efficiency with the help of the identified indicators
	is demonstrated for Italian cities. Applying the methods to wider
	datasets seems promising as it might lead to important insights which
	could impact policy measures on urban development and its funding
	efficiency analyses and allocation processes.},
