  number = {4},
  abstract = {Quality of life has two meanings pertinent to geographers.The understanding
	of one's environment, constructed and otherwise, learned in geography
	contributes to the quality of one's life in the personal sense.The
	objective meaning refers to the characteristics of society in a given
	place and time, the conditions within which people seek happiness.
