	these tasks is often poor, processing results produced by statistical
	packages is quite laborious and vulnerable to error. I will therefore
	present a new package called estout that facilitates and automates
	some of these tasks. This new command can be used to produce regression
	tables for use with spreadsheets, LATEX, HTML, or word processors.
